TeX engine be installed (see --pdf-engine below). Alternatively, pandoc can use ConTeXt, roff ms, or HTML as an intermediate format. To do this, specify an output file with a .pdf extension, as before, but add the --pdf-engine option or -t context, -t html, or -t ms to the command line. The tool used to generate the PDF from the intermediate format may be specified using --pdf-engine.\nYou can control the PDF style using variables, depending on the intermediate format used: see [n2l146] variables for LaTeX, [n2l147] variables for ConTeXt, [n2l148] variables for wkhtmltopdf, [n2l149] variables for ms. When HTML is used as an intermediate format, the output can be styled using --css.\nTo debug the PDF creation, it can be useful to look at the intermediate representation: instead of -o test.pdf, use for example -s -o test.tex to output the generated LaTeX. You can then test it with pdflatex test.tex.\nWhen using LaTeX, the following packages need to be available (they are included with all recent versions of TeX Live): amsfonts, amsmath, lm, unicode-math, iftex, listings (if the --listings option is used), fancyvrb, longtable, booktabs, graphicx (if the ","body_utf8_bytes":1350,"content_codepoints":1314,"content_utf8_bytes":1314,"corpus_sha256":"a2507268ef20cc0b9dc55b351b44e7973961e352f17f86dbb3b2b01dc3127b2d","deferred_link_ids":[],"display_codepoints":1428,"display_sha256":"62f192f241b8b519d666eaedddfaf5179b0aa4f1f83634920723af3c4cf5c709","display_text":"[p21403 2.14.0.3 offset=7357]\nCreating a PDF\nTo produce a PDF, specify an output file with a .pdf extension:\npandoc test.txt -o test.pdf\nBy default, pandoc will use LaTeX to create the PDF, which requires that a LaTeX engine be installed (see --pdf-engine below). Alternatively, pandoc can use ConTeXt, roff ms, or HTML as an intermediate format. To do this, specify an output file with a .pdf extension, as before, but add the --pdf-engine option or -t context, -t html, or -t ms to the command line. The tool used to generate the PDF from the intermediate format may be specified using --pdf-engine.\nYou can control the PDF style using variables, depending on the intermediate format used: see [n2l146] variables for LaTeX, [n2l147] variables for ConTeXt, [n2l148] variables for wkhtmltopdf, [n2l149] variables for ms. When HTML is used as an intermediate format, the output can be styled using --css.\nTo debug the PDF creation, it can be useful to look at the intermediate representation: instead of -o test.pdf, use for example -s -o test.tex to output the generated LaTeX. You can then test it with pdflatex test.tex.\nWhen using LaTeX, the following packages need to be available (they are included with all recent versions of TeX Live): amsfonts, amsmath, lm, unicode-math, iftex, listings (if the --listings option is used), fancyvrb, longtable, booktabs, graphicx (if the \n[next] 다음 구간 | [again] 재열람 | [back] 직전 열람(있으면)\n","display_utf8_bytes":1456,"doc_id":"p21403","document_navigation_codepoints":36,"document_navigation_intervals":[[8023,8032],[8053,8062],[8085,8094],[8121,8130]],"document_navigation_utf8_bytes":36,"document_version":"2.14.0.3","fragment":"creating-a-pdf","fragment_basis":"nearest_preceding_fixed_anchor","http_request_performed":false,"navigation_classification_supplied":true,"navigation_codepoints":78,"navigation_text":"[p21403 2.14.0.3 offset=7357]\n\n[next] 다음 구간 | [again] 재열람 | [back] 직전 열람(있으면)\n","navigation_utf8_bytes":106,"next_offset":8707,"offset_end":8707,"offset_start":7357,"partial_link_ids":[],"render_reserve_codepoints":150,"requested_document_url":"https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html","source_sha":"001be3d1f162f8cb64b420cf9457fdaf518e775455e10c477a6632d988a58cb8","source_slice_codepoints":1350,"source_slice_utf8_bytes":1350,"total_navigation_codepoints":114,"total_navigation_utf8_bytes":142,"transport":"offline_fixed_document_viewer","visible_link_ids":["n2l146","n2l147","n2l148","n2l149"]}}
{"answer":{"citations":[{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"To produce a PDF, specify an output file with a .pdf extension:"},{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"By default, pandoc will use LaTeX to create the PDF, which requires that a LaTeX engine be installed"},{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"To debug the PDF creation, it can be useful to look at the intermediate representation"}],"disposition":"부분 확인","exceptions":"LaTeX 경로에는 엔진 설치가 필요하다. 표 제거 및 그림 교체 대조의 결과나 예외는 보지 못했다. 생성된 LaTeX 중간 표현을 출력하여 조사하는 방법은 안내되어 있다.","operation":"PDF 생성은 출력 파일을 .pdf 확장자로 지정하는 방식이며, 기본 경로는 LaTeX 엔진을 사용한다. ConTeXt, roff ms, HTML 중간 형식도 선택할 수 있으므로 실제 사용하는 출력 경로를 특정해야 한다.","preservation":"PDF 스타일을 중간 형식별 변수로 조절할 수 있다는 설명은 확인했지만, 그림이 다음 페이지로 떠도 후속 텍스트와 표의 하단 여백이 보존된다는 보장은 아직 찾지 못했다."},"at_utc":"2026-11-24T05:16:58.755711+00:00","command_wall_seconds":0.14969237200000407,"elapsed_is_wall_not_human_active_time":true,"elapsed_since_exposure_seconds":21.833272,"event":"answer","event_sha256":"fa22e6bbcdc3401aa4f0a05d9070b74d48c2842b73f8451e564def65940620fb","exposure_event_sha256":"46cb4ad1345e6b046bae59d2b9ac68965a2d546da304a233225bb1f0a23807a5","previous_event_sha256":"46cb4ad1345e6b046bae59d2b9ac68965a2d546da304a233225bb1f0a23807a5","recorded_before_next_open":true,"seq":7,"session":"r08","step":2}
